It implements methods described in:
  - Wu et al., Eulerian Video Magnification for Revealing Subtle Changes in the World, SIGGRAPH 2012.
  - Wadhwa et al., Riesz Pyramids for Fast Phase-Based Video Magnification, ICCP 2014.
  - Kroeger et al., Fast Optical Flow using Dense Inverse Search, ECCV 2016.
  - Potamias et al., WiLoR: End-to-end 3D Hand Localization and Reconstruction in-the-wild, CVPR 2025.
  - Romero, Tzionas, Black, Embodied Hands: Modeling and Capturing Hands and Bodies Together (MANO), SIGGRAPH Asia 2017.

